{"4930280": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Super Football Arena", "steam_appid": 4930280, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An intense online soccer game supporting 2 to 8 players. The only rule here is VICTORY! Punching, tackling, and even magic are 100% legal on this pitch. Welcome to the most chaotic soccer match of your life!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >No Referees, No Rules</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The referee has been dealt with. Now, you can use any means necessary to steal the ball from your opponents. Punches, kicks, or even fireballs—everything goes! Leave sportsmanship behind; your only goal is to WIN!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4930280/extras/a2794d7448f84ad10f0bba1142431d76.poster.avif?t=1784254902\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4930280/extras/a2794d7448f84ad10f0bba1142431d76.webm?t=1784254902\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4930280/extras/a2794d7448f84ad10f0bba1142431d76.mp4?t=1784254902\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Master Your Skills</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mix and match your skills to dominate the game. Unleash powerful skill shots, blast opponents away, build massive defensive walls, or plant hidden mines. It's time to show your rivals who's boss!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4930280/extras/de151b46dda121e452f17fd3b504be3e.poster.avif?t=1784254902\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4930280/extras/de151b46dda121e452f17fd3b504be3e.webm?t=1784254902\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4930280/extras/de151b46dda121e452f17fd3b504be3e.mp4?t=1784254902\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4930280/extras/36f7c0a9982c7a014964a33ed15bddf0.poster.avif?t=1784254902\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4930280/extras/36f7c0a9982c7a014964a33ed15bddf0.webm?t=1784254902\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4930280/extras/36f7c0a9982c7a014964a33ed15bddf0.mp4?t=1784254902\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Diverse Arenas &amp; Game Modes</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a wide variety of unique stadiums and game modes. Adapt your skill loadout to match the environment and maximize your power on the pitch!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4930280/extras/0cfd4b043a1b68b3d2cbc76a11d51b6a.poster.avif?t=1784254902\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4930280/extras/0cfd4b043a1b68b3d2cbc76a11d51b6a.webm?t=1784254902\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4930280/extras/0cfd4b043a1b68b3d2cbc76a11d51b6a.mp4?t=1784254902\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Up to 8-player online multiplayer madness!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Kick off in dozens of unique, stylized stadiums.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A vast selection of offensive, defensive, and support skills to play your way.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Character customization, cool victory dances, and expressive emotes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In-game voice chat to coordinate (or trash-talk) with friends.</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An intense online soccer game supporting 2 to 8 players. The only rule here is VICTORY! Punching, tackling, and even magic are 100% legal on this pitch. Welcome to the most chaotic soccer match of your life!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >No Referees, No Rules</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The referee has been dealt with. Now, you can use any means necessary to steal the ball from your opponents. Punches, kicks, or even fireballs—everything goes! Leave sportsmanship behind; your only goal is to WIN!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4930280/extras/a2794d7448f84ad10f0bba1142431d76.poster.avif?t=1784254902\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4930280/extras/a2794d7448f84ad10f0bba1142431d76.webm?t=1784254902\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4930280/extras/a2794d7448f84ad10f0bba1142431d76.mp4?t=1784254902\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Master Your Skills</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mix and match your skills to dominate the game. Unleash powerful skill shots, blast opponents away, build massive defensive walls, or plant hidden mines. It's time to show your rivals who's boss!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4930280/extras/de151b46dda121e452f17fd3b504be3e.poster.avif?t=1784254902\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4930280/extras/de151b46dda121e452f17fd3b504be3e.webm?t=1784254902\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4930280/extras/de151b46dda121e452f17fd3b504be3e.mp4?t=1784254902\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4930280/extras/36f7c0a9982c7a014964a33ed15bddf0.poster.avif?t=1784254902\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4930280/extras/36f7c0a9982c7a014964a33ed15bddf0.webm?t=1784254902\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4930280/extras/36f7c0a9982c7a014964a33ed15bddf0.mp4?t=1784254902\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Diverse Arenas &amp; Game Modes</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a wide variety of unique stadiums and game modes. Adapt your skill loadout to match the environment and maximize your power on the pitch!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4930280/extras/0cfd4b043a1b68b3d2cbc76a11d51b6a.poster.avif?t=1784254902\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4930280/extras/0cfd4b043a1b68b3d2cbc76a11d51b6a.webm?t=1784254902\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4930280/extras/0cfd4b043a1b68b3d2cbc76a11d51b6a.mp4?t=1784254902\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Up to 8-player online multiplayer madness!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Kick off in dozens of unique, stylized stadiums.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A vast selection of offensive, defensive, and support skills to play your way.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Character customization, cool victory dances, and expressive emotes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In-game voice chat to coordinate (or trash-talk) with friends.</p></li></ul>", "short_description": "A soccer game supporting 2 to 8 players in simultaneous online competition. The only rule here is VICTORY! Punching, tackling, and even magic are 100% legal on this pitch. Welcome to the most chaotic soccer match of your life!", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, Japanese<strong>*</strong>, Korean<strong>*</strong>, Polish<strong>*</strong>, Portuguese - Portugal<strong>*</strong>, Simplified Chinese<strong>*</strong>, Traditional Chinese<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4930280/c0f8d21b948e9513ff01b05493a24d06d2893d72/header.jpg?t=1784254902", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4930280/d50588e913147cb221ff06f2d68718cdddfbd152/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1784254902", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4930280/d50588e913147cb221ff06f2d68718cdddfbd152/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1784254902", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS: